# Whizle App - Environment Variables Template
#
# This project is organized as a monorepo with separate client and server applications.
# Please copy the respective example environment files:
#
# 1. Frontend:
#    cp client/.env.example client/.env
#
# 2. Backend:
#    cp server/.env.example server/.env
#
# Refer to the root README.md for detailed setup instructions.
